<Editorial
  title="Small business. Considered choices."
  description="Tagrivo helps independent sellers choose shipping equipment with clear evidence, practical tools, and respect for their time."
>
  <p>
    <strong>Tagrivo is the public brand of an independent editorial project</strong> specializing in
    thermal label printer research, recommendations and comparisons for US sellers. Tagrivo is one
    of the projects developed under JC Labs, the creator's personal brand for digital projects.
    Legal operator and data-controller details remain to be defined for this preview edition.
  </p>
  <p>
    A label printer is a small purchase with an outsized place in your working day. It sits between
    an order and a package ready to leave. When it fits your setup, it fades into the workflow. When
    it doesn’t, every label becomes another task.
  </p>
  <p>
    Tagrivo exists to make that choice clearer for US sellers, especially people building businesses
    on Etsy, Shopify, and eBay.
  </p>
  <h2>An advisor for your packing desk.</h2>
  <p>
    We focus on compatibility, connectivity, and ownership cost. Our{' '}
    <a href="/printer-finder/">Printer Finder</a> starts with your setup. Our{' '}
    <a href="/compare/">comparison tool</a> puts the trade-offs next to each other. Our{' '}
    <a href="/cost-calculator/">cost calculator</a> lets you use the numbers that matter to your
    business.
  </p>
  <h2>Specific evidence. Honest boundaries.</h2>
  <p>
    This edition is based on manufacturer specifications and support documentation. We have not
    hands-on tested the printers in our catalog. We do not publish invented review scores,
    testimonials, or performance measurements.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every product analysis links to its sources and records a check date. Unknowns stay visible. A
    missing verified price is a reason to check the offer, not an invitation to invent a bargain.
  </p>
  <h2>Useful first. Independent always.</h2>
  <p>
    Tagrivo is designed to be supported by affiliate commissions when configured. A purchase may
    generate a commission without an additional charge from Tagrivo. It does not buy a place in the
    shortlist or determine a compatibility result.
  </p>
  <p>
    Read our <a href="/methodology/">editorial methodology</a> and{' '}
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> to understand the distinction between
    documented facts, editorial judgment, and commercial links.
  </p>
  <h2>Print smarter. Ship better.</h2>
  <p>
    That means fewer assumptions before you buy, a more useful picture of costs, and equipment
    chosen around the way you actually work.
  </p>
  <p>
    For editorial questions and corrections, email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hello.jclabs@gmail.com">hello.jclabs@gmail.com</a>. Our{' '}
    <a href="/contact/">contact and corrections page</a> explains what information helps us review a
    correction.
  </p>
</Editorial>
